Ben is a fairly proficient fighter, even as a [[Human (Classic)|human]], being able to hold his own against [[Pierce Wheels|Pierce]].<ref name="V">''[[Voided]]''</ref>{{Refn|[[:File:Nothing on Earth With Ship's Speed.PNG]]|group = DM}} Although he mainly employs a loose street fighting style,<ref name="CaFS" /> he also knows martial arts,{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Knows Martial Arts.png]]|group = DM|name = fame}} having been trained in savate and karate by [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]], and Marquess of Queensbury boxing.<ref name="BK">''[[Be-Knighted]]''</ref> On top of that, he has gained practical experience from years of fighting aliens. He copied a lot of his fighting moves from [[Abel North|Kangaroo Commando]].{{Refn|[[:File:Super Alien Hero Buddy Adventures Pop-up (6).png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="SAHBA">''[[Super Alien Hero Buddy Adventures (Episode)|Super Alien Hero Buddy Adventures]]''</ref>

Ben is able over easily overpower [[Simian]]<ref name="BOAF"> </ref> and knock out a Forever Knight with a punch square in the face.<ref name="TBotE">''[[The Beginning of the End]]''</ref> 

Ben has also received basic [[Plumbers (Classic)|Plumber]] training, having succeeded in the [[Plumbers' Academy]] with a 95 out of a 100.<ref name="BT" />

It is evident that Ben is smart in some respects, possessing an above-average to high intelligence and maintaining a B+ average at school. Gwen even stated that he really is not working up to his potential at school.<ref name="WtMH">''[[Where the Magic Happens]]''</ref> He managed to get 95 out of 100 on the Plumbers' Academy test, only 3 points less than Gwen, showing that he can be quite intelligent when he pays attention.<ref name="BT" />

Ben has an extraordinarily sharp memory, as he was perfectly capable of remembering and writing down the mystic rune-like symbols for entering the inter-dimensional realm of [[Legerdomain]] with just one glance from a distance.<ref name="WtMH" /> This is even more true for things that interest him.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Has Excellent Memory.PNG]]|group = DM}}

Ben can jump high in the air<ref name="OPaP1" /> and is acrobatic, able to perform flips even as a 10-year-old.<ref>''[[The Visitor]]''</ref>

Ben has good reflexes, being able to easily dodge shots from [[Manny Armstrong|Manny's]] blasters before disarming him while in [[Human (Classic)|human]] form,<ref name="AaB">''[[Above and Beyond]]''</ref> dodge [[Sunder|Sunder's]] axe attacks,<ref>''[[Singlehanded]]''</ref> Zed's lunges,<ref name="OPaP1">''[[Of Predators and Prey: Part 1]]''</ref> and a laser blast from [[Tummyhead]].<ref name="RtF">''[[Return to Forever]]''</ref>

Ben has great willpower, capable of breaking free from [[Hypnotick]]'s hypnosis<ref name="Malefactor">''[[Malefactor]]''</ref> and withstanding [[Lord Transyl]]'s mind control.<ref name="TVSB">''[[The Vampire Strikes Back]]''</ref>

Ben is surprisingly a natural at [[hoverboard]]-based combat, which generally requires intensive training and the use of holographic simulators.{{Refn|[[:File:Hoverboard Combat.PNG]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="SOTO" /> Relatedly, he is also good at snowboarding.<ref name="MW">''[[Monster Weather]]''</ref>

Ben has shown himself to be quite a proficient gunman, as he demonstrated with a [[DNA Repair Gun]].

Ben is a proficient swordsman, as he demonstrated with [[Ascalon]].<ref name="TUE2">''[[The Ultimate Enemy: Part 2]]''</ref>

Ben is proficient at driving, having been taught by [[Max Tennyson (Classic)|Max]].<ref name="Paradox">''[[Paradox]]''</ref> For example, he was able to swerve out of the way at the last second to avoid coming into contact with [[Eunice]]'s crashing pod.<ref name="TToE">''[[The Transmogrification of Eunice]]''</ref>

Ben has impressive piloting skills, as shown when, at 10 years old, he could adequately control a [[gyropod]] (a small ship designed for alien pilots) within seconds of testing,<ref name="SOTO" /> and at 16 years old, could pilot the [[Rustbucket 3]].<ref name="TEoME">''[[The Enemy of My Enemy]]''</ref> He gets this skill from a combination of playing video games and tap lessons [[Sandra Tennyson|Sandra]] made him take, though he would never admit it.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Pilot.PNG]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="SOTO" /> Despite this, [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] is considered to be a better pilot than Ben.{{Refn|[[:File:P'Andor Imprisoned.PNG]]|group = DM}}

Ben is proficient at baseball.<ref name="TU" />

Ben is proficient at soccer, serving as a goalie for his high school team.<ref name="B10RP1"/><ref name="WotW1" /> In fact, he was the first freshman start as goalie on his school's team.{{Refn|[[:File:AF Ben Brief.png]]|group = AF Brief|name = af brief}}

Ben is a decent musician, as he knew a variety of electric guitar techniques like shredding, hammer-ons, and pinch harmonics, and on drums, was able to keep up with a professional rock band.<ref name="MW" />

Ben has a knack for turning his weaknesses into strengths.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Weaknesses Strengths.PNG]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="SOTO" />

