{{Quote|"You are...one of us?"<br>"I'm one of everybody."|A [[Necrofriggian (Classic)|Necrofriggian]] Guard and [[Big Chill (Classic)|Big Chill]].<ref>''[[Map of Infinity (Episode)|Map of Infinity]]''</ref>}}
Ben is the wielder of the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] (formerly the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] and [[Omnitrix (Original)|first Omnitrix]]), which gives him the power to modify his own genetic code in order to turn into various alien creatures. Traditionally, he could only transform into ten aliens at the beginning of both the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''', but he later gained additional forms by either unlocking them or by scanning the DNA of aliens he met.

When transforming into an alien, Ben gets all the creature's features, including its appearance, voice, all of its unique and special abilities and powers, strengths and weaknesses. Though he mostly retains his personality, there are some cases where the transformation causes a change in it, like with [[Rath (Classic)|Rath]] and [[Juryrigg]].

Though he usually uses his alien forms to fight, he can impersonate aliens as he did with [[Waterhazard]] to convince [[P'Andor]] to go home, though he was only successful at getting P'Andor to believe he was [[Bivalvan]].<ref>''[[Too Hot to Handle]]''</ref>

In addition to transforming into aliens, the Ultimatrix included what is referred as an "evolutionary function", that allowed Ben to evolve his alien forms, referred to as [[Ultimate Forms]].

In addition to the primary transformations and evolutionary function, the Omnitrices and Ultimatrix can both be used for various purposes. Both have a built-in [[Universal Translator]] that allows Ben to communicate with most aliens that do not speak English.<ref>''[[Escape From Aggregor]]''</ref>

The original Omnitrix displayed the ability to manipulate and repair genetic damage, a function he used to cure DNAliens<ref name="MO">''[[Max Out]]''</ref> and save the Highbreed from extinction.<ref name="WotW2">''[[War of the Worlds: Part 2]]''</ref> [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]] also mentioned that Ben could use the original Omnitrix to bring back to life any species stored on [[Primus]].<ref>''[[Primus (Episode)|Primus]]''</ref>

The current Omnitrix also has a failsafe to help prevent Ben from dying.<ref name="AND">''[[A New Dawn]]''</ref>

Ben formerly owned an [[Hoverboard|X321 hoverboard]], given to him by [[Tetrax Shard (Classic)|Tetrax]].<ref name="Hunted">''[[Hunted]]''</ref> It was destroyed when it fell into a vat of nuclear waste.<ref name="SOTO" /> Tetrax gave him a second hoverboard which was later destroyed by [[Khyber]].<ref name="OPaP1" /> The second hoverboard was later either rebuilt or replaced.<ref name="CT" >''[[Collect This]]''</ref>

Ben owns a [[Plumber Badge]].<ref name="OPaP2">''[[Of Predators and Prey: Part 2]]''</ref>

Ben has a [[Plumber Suit|Plumber suit]], allowing him to survive in unsuitable environments. [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] modified his suit by installing a propulsion unit and neuroshock pulsers.<ref>''[[Deep]]''</ref>

As a [[Galactic Enforcers|Galactic Enforcer]], Ben had a badge which allowed him to activate some features from the team's ship remotely.<ref name="TGE">''[[The Galactic Enforcers]]''</ref>

Ben formerly had a hazmat suit, given to him by [[Max Tennyson (Classic)|Max]]. The suit protected him from the effects of [[Corrodium]]<ref name="UW" /> and allowed him to survive in space.<ref name="BAotD">''[[Be Afraid of the Dark]]''</ref>

Ben temporarily wore a spacesuit, given to him by Tetrax, which allowed him to survive in space.<ref name="SOTO" />

Ben temporarily used an [[ID Mask]] to disguise himself as a [[DNAlien]] to navigate a [[Highbreed Cruiser]].

Ben temporarily drove [[Kevin's Car (Original)|Kevin's car]] when [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] had been aged into an old man by the [[Hugo|Time Monster]].<ref name="Paradox" />

Ben formerly wielded a [[DNA Repair Gun]], which he used to revert the DNAliens back to [[Human (Classic)|human]].<ref name="WotW1" /> [[Simian]] later sold it to the [[Incursean (Classic)|Incursean]]s.<ref name="SS" />

Ben temporarily used [[Max's Motorcycle|Max's motorcycle]] during '''''[[Ben 10: Alien Swarm|Alien Swarm]]'''''.

Ben formerly owned the [[Mark 10]], given to him as a birthday gift by Kevin.<ref name="AS">'''''[[Ben 10: Alien Swarm]]'''''</ref> The car is now owned by [[Sandra Tennyson|Sandra]].{{Refn|[[:File:Sandra Drives the Mark 10.png]]|group = DJW}}

Ben temporarily wielded [[Ascalon]], which also covered him in armor.<ref name="TUE2" />

Ben, as Juryrigg, created the [[Tenn-Speed]] from parts of the destroyed [[Proto-TRUK]].<ref name="RoE">''[[Rules of Engagement]]''</ref> It was later damaged by Ben off-screen prior to ''[[Let's Do the Time War Again]]'', and its parts were used by [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Ben 10,000]] as [[Uprigg]] to create the [[Time Cycles]]. Both Time Cycles were destroyed when Ben and [[Rook Blonko|Rook]] crash-landed onto the [[Contumelia Ship]].<ref name="AND" />

When in ''[[Sumo Slammer Smackdown]]'', he had access to a sword.<ref name="GO">''[[Game Over]]''</ref>

