==Weaknesses==
<gallery type="slideshow">
SZTWC (79).png|Coulrophobia
TSoC (173).png|Cold Virus Vulnerability
Midmad (125).png|Hypnosis Vulnerability
CHS (256).png|Affected By Alien Biology
