Ben appears to have a short attention span and very little patience at times.{{Refn|[[:File:Gwen 10 is Better.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="G10">''[[Gwen 10 (Episode)|Gwen 10]]''</ref> More often than not, it can get him into trouble, such as not reading the directions when trapped in ''[[Sumo Slammer Smackdown]]''.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben's Impatience.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="GO" /> Though he has matured substantially since receiving the [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]], he is still a teenager with much to learn and is prone to irrational impulses and recklessness.

Ben has coulrophobia (i.e. a fear of clowns),<ref name="LL">''[[Last Laugh]]''</ref> which was indirectly caused by [[Max Tennyson (Classic)|Max]].{{Refn|In '''Ultimate Alien''', Ben's coulrophobia came from being scared by a clown at the circus when he was four.<ref name="TUS"/> This was changed in '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', as Ben's coulrophobia came from seeing [[Max Tennyson (Classic)|Max]] in clown make-up when he was five.<ref name="SZTWC">''[[Something Zombozo This Way Comes]]''</ref>{{Refn|[[Contradictory Retcons (Classic)|Contradictory Retcons]]|group = BTP|name = retcons}}|group = note}}

Ben is vulnerable to the cold virus.<ref name="SE">''[[Side Effects]]''</ref>

Ben is vulnerable to hypnosis.<ref name="MM">''[[Midnight Madness]]''</ref>

Ben is not immune to [[Corrodium]] and will be mutated when exposed to this mineral unless he either wears special protection or transforms into an alien.<ref name="UW" /><ref name="BAotD" />

Ben has an allergy to peanuts.<ref>''[[Blukic and Driba Go to Mr. Smoothy's]]''</ref>

Ben's worst fear is that of [[Wikipedia:Peacock|peacocks]].<ref name="AD">''[[Arrested Development]]''</ref><ref name="Rook">[[Rook Blonko]]</ref><ref name="SP1"/>

Ben's worst subject is Physics.<ref name="GCBC">''[[Good Copy, Bad Copy]]''</ref>

Whenever the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] times out, Ben is left powerless until he either dodges or switches to a new alien form. In addition to gaining the selected alien's powers and strengths, he gains its weaknesses.

At times, the natural biological behavior of certain aliens can override Ben's behavior, such as [[Big Chill (Classic)|Big Chill's]] reproductive phase<ref name="StLD">''[[Save the Last Dance]]''</ref> or [[Swampfire|Swampfire's]] blossoming process.<ref name="CIS">''[[Charmed, I'm Sure]]''</ref>

Any illness Ben is experiencing in his human form will affect his alien forms.<ref name="SE" /><ref name="TSoC">''[[The Secret of Chromastone]]''</ref>

