*In '''Alien Force''', Ben was in his freshman year of high school.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben and Gwen Freshmen.PNG]]|group = DM}}{{Refn|[[:File:AF Ben Bandai Card.png]]|group = Bandai|name = Bandai}}  
**In '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', his teachers were not nice on grading him, but they were fine with his bad attendance record.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben UA Bad Attendance Record.png]]|group = DM}}
**Ben still goes to school in '''Omniverse''', but not much. He can get an excused absence very easily,<ref>[[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin Levin]]</ref><ref name="INEBG" /> and his assistance to the Plumbers counts as work-study.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Still Goes to School in OV.png]]|group = MW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Still Goes to School in OV 2.png]]|group = MW}}
*Ben used to shout the names of his aliens because they were asserting their identity as they gained consciousness,{{Refn|group = DM|name = name shout}} as well as to strike fear into his opponents.<ref name="PN775iM">''[[Prisoner Number 775 is Missing]]''</ref> He stopped doing so, and changed his outfit, in '''Omniverse''' because he got tired of it.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Got Tired of Shouting His Aliens' Names.png]]|group = MW|name = tired}}
**It was Dwayne's idea to have Ben shout the names of his aliens, as he thought it would help younger fans know the aliens' names.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Shouting Out Alien Names.PNG]]|group = DM}}{{Refn|group = DM|name = name shout}}
*Ben has a lot of pull with the Plumbers.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Has A Lot of Pull With The Plumbers.PNG]]|group = DM|name = pay}}
*It is unknown if Ben gets paid for his Plumber work.{{Refn|group = DM|name = pay}} 
**However, his line "We better be getting hazard pay for this" in ''[[Mud is Thicker Than Water]]'' implies that he and Gwen are on a payroll, even though Ben is no longer officially a Plumber.<ref name="TRoAE">''[[The Rooters of All Evil]]''</ref>
**In ''[[Hot Stretch]]'' and ''[[Many Happy Returns]]'', it is shown that Ben somehow possesses pieces of [[Tayden|Taydens]], indicating that he earns money somehow.
*Ben has other friends than the ones seen on-screen, but his coming out of retirement in '''Alien Force''' pushed them away.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Has Other Friends.PNG]]|group = DM}}
*Ben has not thought about his career plan at all.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben and Gwen's Career Plans.PNG]]|group = DM}}
*Ben misses the good old days when he used to hang out with Gwen and Kevin without being mobbed by fans,{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Misses the Good Old Days.PNG]]|group = DM}} so much that he secretly hates being famous and wishes he had his secret identity back.<ref name="AP2">''[[Absolute Power: Part 2]]''</ref>
**However, Dwayne later stated he did not believe that Ben hates being mobbed by fans despite Ben saying otherwise.{{Refn|group = DM|name = fame}}
*Ben knows some things about the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|original Ultimatrix]] that [[Eunice]] doesn't, and vice versa.{{Refn|[[:File:Eunice Knows Things About the Ultimatrix.PNG]]|group = MW}}
*Ben considers both [[Rook Blonko|Rook]] and Kevin his best friend.{{Refn|[[:File:Celestialsapiens Can Die.png]]|group = MW}}
*Ben still owns several black T-shirts.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Still Has Several Black T-Shirts.png]]|group = MW}}
*Ben sometimes goes to [[Undertown]] just to hang out.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Goes to Undertown to Hang Out.png]]|group = MW|name = forumotion}}
*Ben sometimes thinks about moving to an apartment or [[Plumber Headquarters (Omniverse)|Plumber Headquarters]] due to the trouble he brings to his home.{{Refn|group = MW|name = forumotion}}
*Ben owns a [[Tetramand (Classic)|Tetramand]] flag in his bedroom.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Has a Tetramand Flag.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Before the events of the '''Original Series''':
**Ben and Gwen once did not speak to each other for two months over an argument about a stick of gum.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Gwen Gum.PNG]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="B10vN10P1">''[[Ben 10 vs. Negative 10: Part 1]]''</ref>
**At one point, the arguing between Ben and Gwen had gotten so bad that their parents refused to take vacations together anymore.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben Gwen Parents Vacation.PNG]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="SOTO" />
*During the road trip in the '''Original Series''':
**Disliking [[Max Tennyson (Classic)|Max's]] cooking was one of the few things Ben and Gwen agreed on.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben and Gwen Agree on Something.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="UWpon">''[[Ultimate Weapon]]''</ref>
**Ben was secretly sorry for what happened to Kevin.{{Refn|[[:File:Perfect Day Pop-up (19).png]]|group = pop-up|name = PD pop-up}}<ref name="PD"/>
**Ben still had gym clothes from the first grade in his gym locker.{{Refn|[[:File:Perfect Day Pop-up (23).png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="PD" />
*'''[[Sumo Slammers (Classic)|Sumo Slammers]]''' is Ben's favorite game, book, and TV show, followed by '''Space Pirates'''.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben's Favorite Stuff.png]]|group = pop-up|name = favorite}}<ref name="GO"/>
**Initially, '''[[w:c:secretsaturdays:Weird_World|Weird World]]''' was stated to be one of Ben's favorite shows.{{Refn|group = pop-up|name = favorite}}<ref name="GO"/> However, this is retconned in ''[[T.G.I.S.]]'', as Ben states that he did not watch the show very often as it was on at the same time as '''Sumo Slammers'''.{{Refn|group = BTP|name = retcons}}
*Ben's fight with his hero, [[Abel North|Kangaroo Commando]], in ''[[Super Alien Hero Buddy Adventures (Episode)|Super Alien Hero Buddy Adventures]]'' is one of his favorite memories.{{Refn|[[:File:Super Alien Hero Buddy Adventures Pop-up (7).png]]|group = pop-up|name = img}}<ref name="SAHBA" />
*When he was younger, Ben's high energy often got him into trouble. As he got older, he learned to focus that energy into sports.{{Refn|[[:File:High Energy Ben.PNG]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="SOTO" />{{Refn|''[[Azmuth & Galactic Enforcers Ben]]'', Galactic Enforcers Ben Top Secret File|group = DVD}}{{Refn|[[:File:Ben gets in trouble.png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="B10RP1">''[[Ben 10 Returns: Part 1]]''</ref>
*The loss of [[Feedback]], who was Ben's favorite alien at the time, was supposed to be the reason Ben took off the [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]] and retired from being a hero,{{Refn|[[:File:Reason For Ben Removing the Omnitrix.png]]|group = MW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Glen and Dwayne's Idea For Feedback.PNG]]|group = DJW|name = history}} but it was ultimately [[Cartoon Network]] executives who vetoed the idea, which many crew members were thankful for.{{Refn|[[:File:CN Vetoed Dwayne and Glen's Feedback Idea.png]]|group = DJW}} 
**Prior to '''Omniverse''', the five-year gap between the '''Original Series''' and '''Alien Force''' was discussed and various possibilities were kicked around, everything from "Wow, what if there's something huge and cool that happened there" to "Maybe absolutely nothing interesting happened there".{{Refn|[[:File:OS and AF Gap Possibilities.png]]|group = ES}}
**Although the '''Alien Force''' crew did not specify how long Ben had the Omnitrix off,{{Refn|group = DM|name = name shout}} the '''Alien Force''' master brief stated that he removed it shortly after defeating [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]] in '''''[[Ben 10: Secret of the Omnitrix|Secret of the Omnitrix]]'''''.{{Refn|[[:File:AF Series Brief.png]]|group = AF Brief}}
*[[Adam Wylie]] auditioned to voice Ben for the '''Original Series''' (at [[Meagan Smith]]'s suggestion) and '''Alien Force'''.{{Refn|https://www.cameo.com/recipient/6949ab4ecd64559a7aacfb28|group = AW}}
*Many voice actors auditioned to voice Ben in '''Alien Force'''. [[Yuri Lowenthal]] was called back multiple times before landing the role.{{Refn|[[:File:AF Ben Audition Process.png]]|group = YL}}{{Refn|https://youtu.be/QcMiHq_53GA|group = YL}}
**[[Glen Murakami]] told Yuri that Ben was now a little bit older, not quite as prone to say a wisecrack like he would before. At the same time, he said he did not want him to veer into the whining, {{W|Luke Skywalker}} "I got to go to this space station to pick up some moisture evaporators" kind of character.{{Refn|[[:File:Glen Murakami's Instructions for Yuri Lowenthal in Alien Force.png]]|group = YL}}
*Ben's '''Original Series''' design was made by [[Dave Johnson]],{{Refn|[[:File:Dave Designed OS Ben, Gwen & Omnitrix.PNG]]|group = DJ}} while his Ultra Ben persona was designed by [[Thomas N. Perkins IV]].{{Refn|[[:File:Tom Designed S3 & S4 Characters.png]]|group = TNP}}
*Initial concepts for 15 and 16-year-old Ben's '''Alien Force''' and '''Ultimate Alien''' design were made by Glen. His head and hair were reworked by [[Glenn Wong]], who also gave him his green jacket, while colors were added by Chris Hooten.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben alien force design process.PNG]]|group = GW}}
**Ben's green trunks in ''[[What Are Little Girls Made Of?]]'' and ''[[In Charm's Way]]'' were designed by [[T.J. Collins]].{{Refn|https://archive.is/bt2IW|group = TJC}}
**10-year-old Ben in '''Ultimate Alien''' was designed by Glenn.{{Refn|https://archive.is/DTT2n|group = GW}}
*The out-of-universe reason Ben aged up from 15 to 16 years old in '''Ultimate Alien''' was because [[Bandai]] wanted him to be able to drive a car.{{Refn|group = CM|name = swarm}}
*The out-of-universe reason for Ben's increased immaturity in '''Omniverse''' compared to '''Alien Force''' and '''Ultimate Alien''' was due to a request from the executives.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben's Increased Immaturity in OV Reason.png]]|group = CM}}{{Refn|[[:File:Ben's Increased Immaturity in OV Reason 2.png]]|group = CM}}
**Tangential to this, Yuri felt a slight change in his portrayal of Ben in '''Omniverse''' was needed, and "scraped away" some of Ben's grown-up mannerisms which were present by the end of '''Ultimate Alien'''.{{Refn|https://www.youtube.com/live/unaX1hKhOy4|group = YL}}
*Ben being the subject of many female characters' romantic affections in '''Omniverse''' was because the crew wanted to play around with that old anime trope where the boy character has all these girls that are way out of his league chasing after him, but he's too clueless to do anything about it.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Ben Romance Inspiration.png]]|group = DJW}}
*In the [[Gweniverse]], Ben is not an [[Anodite]]{{Refn|[[:File:Gweniverse Ben Not An Anodite.png]]|group = DJW}} and does not know [[Magic (Classic)|magic]].{{Refn|[[:File:Gweniverse Ben Does Not Know Magic.png]]|group = DJW}} In fact, he does not have any powers in general.{{Refn|[[:File:Gweniverse Ben Does Not Have Powers.png]]|group = DJW}} He is essentially a tagalong that gets in [[Gwen 10 (Gweniverse)|Gwen]]'s way.{{Refn|[[:File:Gweniverse Ben.png]]|group = DJW}}
*There is an alternate version of Ben in the [[Generator Rex Dimension|'''Generator Rex''' Dimension]].{{Refn|[[:File:Possible Alternate Ben in Rex's Universe.png]]|group = DR}}{{Refn|[[:File:There is an alternate version of Ben in Rex's universe.png]]|group = DR}}{{Refn|https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zLeJ1ad0lasJ8ceJAGy0R791awLUBXay/view|name = Prot|group = DR}}
*[[Duncan Rouleau]] originally stated that the four alternate Bens featured in ''[[Alien X-Tinction]]'' are the same as Ben Prime from the previous four series.{{Refn|group=DR|[[:File:All Alternate Bens are Classic Ben.png]]}} However, he later rescinded that statement, stating that they are from alternate timelines.{{Refn|[[:File:AXT Bens are not Prime.png]]|group = DR}}
**[[Cartoon Network]] already indicated this, when it said in the description of a video that [[Ben Tennyson (Alien Force Homage Dimension)|'''Alien Force''' Ben]] and [[Ben Tennyson (Ultimate Alien Homage Dimension)|'''Ultimate Alien''' Ben]] are from different dimensions.{{Refn|https://youtu.be/6aZT9D1S5Oc|group = CN}}
*Ben (as seen in '''Alien Force''') was one of the characters featured in the 2009 Official BBC Children In Need Medley.{{Refn|https://youtu.be/7RD-IyYc1OM|group=BBC}}
*A Rainbow Milk sponsored a Guinness World Record event at Red Sea Mall in Jeddah, Saudi Arabia, where 475 '''Ben 10''' fans gathered dressed as Ben, setting the record for the largest gathering of Ben 10 fans in costume.{{Refn|https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/90101-largest-gathering-of-people-dressed-as-ben10|group = GWR}}

